ave a non-zero element below the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{31} & =5\\ne 0 \\\\ {c}_{32} & =3\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120504 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b19292e-d665-566f-8c6f-7d83c4d69c31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333545} {:answer/id #uuid "7039880d-285d-542d-8eed-1662170a86ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334012} {:answer/id #uuid "7de24423-58a1-5fc2-baf5-dde65d746a91" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "D=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334113} {:answer/id #uuid "ca309238-a2b3-5c28-8c7c-56e6c410616b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334750} {:answer/id #uuid "fbe722d3-8558-53eb-8a6e-850293b2db44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "E=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335199}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3b19292e-d665-566f-8c6f-7d83c4d69c31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333545} :answer-field/id #uuid "96649b7c-8415-520e-af03-f8b52df45dd6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335522}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "91c8b870-01b8-5cdd-a0e6-31fdbbd32f0e" :question/math-academy-id "q-68740" :question/problem "Which of the following is an upper triangular matrix?" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $C$ is a matrix for which all entries *below* the diagonal are $0$'s:\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nHence, it is an upper triangular matrix. \n\nBy contrast, matrices $A$, $B$, $D$, and $E$ each have at least one non-zero entry below the diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,D=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,E=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nSo, they are not upper triangular matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262604 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf88710f-b87c-5266-9c5f-535bd49454b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437734} {:answer/id #uuid "54a08cb6-41ab-5dc1-bc15-470540725af6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437735}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "54a08cb6-41ab-5dc1-bc15-470540725af6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437735} :answer-field/id #uuid "2e9b060c-75fd-538d-8b17-6f8f74704b24" :answer-field/key "A" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438896} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0da38aeb-d192-5fcc-aea2-560c50d82228" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437736} {:answer/id #uuid "eadcc0f5-f9fb-5083-aa37-83f8b2760849" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437737}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eadcc0f5-f9fb-5083-aa37-83f8b2760849" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437737} :answer-field/id #uuid "a5131af3-1aac-5801