)\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- $A$ is upper triangular\n\n- $A$ is lower triangular\n\n- $A^T-A$ is lower triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n![](images/c1/c1ec838cd30cca8fbb2e3996d5a7d84dadb233e1951d05b532a9d606d887eb2f.png)\n\n- Statement II is true, since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros:\n![](images/f3/f39c68a9b1f5e16caffbf159b629a958e147e14099334b049bdfcd857eef84d2.png)\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $A^T-A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n![](images/f4/f4415c87201f5b92f23e3320c313cd58ac4e720135928645896f976614c5eaa0.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050727}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186488405 :question-generator/id #uuid "2ead4764-174c-5d84-bcf9-29e935ade0e4" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186119784.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120422 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "767ebc71-0ad3-54b6-aa71-7c8c0b0f3bfc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438302} {:answer/id #uuid "a63f8938-30f5-513c-a258-cd4d1a6a7304" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438303}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "767ebc71-0ad3-54b6-aa71-7c8c0b0f3bfc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438302} :answer-field/id #uuid "57ffd47f-b693-5f52-b1f1-700e84eec01a" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439180} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2809995c-d5a8-548e-8bde-087503452