iagonal:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $A$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${A}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120426 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76bc55da-83d7-5857-aa45-f67452354c98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439761} {:answer/id #uuid "04de8af5-832b-52ca-a350-f0f854ef704b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439762}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "76bc55da-83d7-5857-aa45-f67452354c98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439761} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c2bf384-0f31-5769-a66a-ac9626e09eb9" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440238} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae221432-f0bc-5791-a903-4cd7033afbd0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439763} {:answer/id #uuid "b1f39cf2-a8e6-5e3d-af10-2464a548d981" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439764}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b1f39cf2-a8e6-5e3d-af10-2464a548d981" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439764} :answer-field/id #uuid "f0b7c5ec-92af-5a70-b92f-f383dbb8df49" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 1759218644023