agonal:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $D$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${D}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{D}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186488404 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "539855fa-6c5d-53c2-8e6b-3ae037750849" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488400} {:answer/id #uuid "88990fe2-e5bf-51c0-a552-f3a9611b1ebd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488401}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "539855fa-6c5d-53c2-8e6b-3ae037750849" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488400} :answer-field/id #uuid "1f123478-0b1d-5380-b456-3eb2029b111c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488396} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1094c3c3-975f-530e-bff0-7807d9d9ab97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488395} {:answer/id #uuid "334bed91-dadd-511d-a2e8-3228c1bd2233" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488397}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1094c3c3-975f-530e-bff0-7807d9d9ab97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488395} :answer-field/id #uuid "8f11f16f-2bde-5b13-90cc-e018dd7a5dfc" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 1759218648840